   "shared_node_rule": "At a velocity node shared by several boundary attributes (edges and corners of the cube, the slip-symmetry edge of T4): (1) Dirichlet beats every natural condition and every slip/symmetry constraint; (2) between Dirichlet attributes the fixed data AGREE (one exact callable per field; checked: dirichlet_shared_node_mismatch_max), so no precedence is needed and the result is independent of attribute order; (3) at a node on two slip/symmetry faces BOTH normal constraints are imposed (u along the common edge only); (4) no periodic boundaries in F1c."
  }
 },
